# ─── DormDrobe Local-First Configuration ──────────────────────────────
# DormDrobe runs in 100% Local-First / Zero-Knowledge mode by default.
# Your wardrobe photos and items never leave the phone.
#
# Optional: To connect a remote Supabase database, supply your keys below:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
